flowchart TD
    Start([Foreground Service Started]) --> InitLocation[Initialize FusedLocationProviderClient]
    InitLocation --> ReqUpdates[Request Periodic Location Updates<br/>High Accuracy GPS]
    ReqUpdates --> CheckGPS{Location Fix Acquired?}
    CheckGPS -- No --> WaitInterval[Wait next interval]
    WaitInterval --> ReqUpdates
    CheckGPS -- Yes --> ExtractTelemetry[Extract Coordinates, Battery Level, Network State]
    ExtractTelemetry --> OnlineCheck{Internet Available?}
    OnlineCheck -- No --> BufferLocal[Buffer location in local cache]
    BufferLocal --> WaitInterval
    OnlineCheck -- Yes --> PushFirestore[Write location batch to Firestore subcollection]
    PushFirestore --> UpdateDevice[Update parent device document lastSeen & status]
    UpdateDevice --> ListenCommands[Check pending commands subcollection]
    ListenCommands --> HasCmd{Pending Command?}
    HasCmd -- No --> WaitInterval
    HasCmd -- Yes --> ExecuteCmd[Execute Command: RING / LOCK / WIPE]
    ExecuteCmd --> AckCmd[Mark command executed in Firestore]
    AckCmd --> WaitInterval
